{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}
<article class="phpdocumentor-element">

    <h1>Zitadel PHP SDK</h1>

    <p class="phpdocumentor-element__summary">
        Zero-dependency PKCE authentication middleware for PHP 8.3+.
        Handles the full OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code + PKCE flow, validates JWTs via JWKS,
        and stores all session state in encrypted HttpOnly cookies —
        no server-side sessions, no database, no custom routes.
    </p>

    <pre class="phpdocumentor-code"><code class="language-bash">composer require zitadel/sdk</code></pre>

    <hr>

    <h2>Quick Start</h2>

    <ol>
        <li>
            <strong>Install</strong><br>
            <code>composer require zitadel/sdk</code>
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Generate a cookie secret</strong><br>
            <code>php -r "echo bin2hex(random_bytes(32)) . PHP_EOL;"</code>
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Set environment variables</strong>
            <dl>
                <dt><code>ZITADEL_ISSUER_URL</code></dt>
                <dd>Your Zitadel instance URL, e.g. <code>https://my.zitadel.cloud</code></dd>
                <dt><code>ZITADEL_CLIENT_ID</code></dt>
                <dd>OAuth 2.0 client ID from the Zitadel console</dd>
                <dt><code>ZITADEL_REDIRECT_URI</code></dt>
                <dd>Full callback URL, e.g. <code>https://myapp.com/zitadel/callback</code></dd>
                <dt><code>ZITADEL_COOKIE_SECRET</code></dt>
                <dd>The 64-character hex string from step 2</dd>
            </dl>
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Follow your framework guide below.</strong>
        </li>
    </ol>

    <hr>

    <h2>Framework Guides</h2>

    <dl class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents">
        <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">
            <a href="guides/laravel.html">Laravel</a>
        </dt>
        <dd>Auto-discovered ServiceProvider and Auth guard. Access claims via <code>auth('zitadel')->user()->claims</code>.</dd>

        <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">
            <a href="guides/symfony.html">Symfony</a>
        </dt>
        <dd>Bundle + <code>KernelEvents</code> listener. Inject <code>?Claims $claims</code> directly into controller actions.</dd>

        <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">
            <a href="guides/yii.html">Yii 3</a>
        </dt>
        <dd>PSR-15 native — add <code>ZitadelMiddleware</code> to the pipeline. Claims via <code>$request->getAttribute('zitadel.claims')</code>.</dd>

        <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">
            <a href="guides/slim.html">Slim 4</a>
        </dt>
        <dd>PSR-15 native, zero bridge. One line: <code>$app->add(new ZitadelMiddleware(...))</code>.</dd>

        <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">
            <a href="guides/mezzio.html">Mezzio</a>
        </dt>
        <dd>PSR-15 native, zero bridge. One line: <code>$app->pipe(ZitadelMiddleware::class)</code>.</dd>

        <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">
            <a href="guides/codeigniter.html">CodeIgniter 4</a>
        </dt>
        <dd>Register <code>ZitadelFilter</code> as a global <code>before</code> filter. Claims via <code>ZitadelHolder::claims()</code>.</dd>

        <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">
            <a href="guides/phalcon.html">Phalcon</a>
        </dt>
        <dd>Micro: <code>$app->before(new ZitadelMicroPlugin(...))</code>. MVC: attach <code>ZitadelPlugin</code> to the events manager.</dd>
    </dl>

    <hr>

    <h2>Architecture</h2>

    <p>The library has three layers:</p>

    <dl>
        <dt><strong>Core</strong> — <code>lib/Auth/</code>, <code>lib/Middleware/</code></dt>
        <dd>Pure PSR-15, zero framework dependencies. <code>ZitadelMiddleware</code> owns the complete
        lifecycle: PKCE redirect, callback, logout, JWT validation, and route protection.</dd>

        <dt><strong>Bridges</strong> — <code>lib/Bridge/</code></dt>
        <dd>Thin, idiomatic adapters per framework. Laravel gets a ServiceProvider and Auth guard;
        Symfony gets a Bundle and value resolver; CI4 gets a <code>FilterInterface</code>;
        Phalcon gets event plugins. Slim and Mezzio need no bridge — the PSR-15 core works directly.</dd>

        <dt><strong>Config</strong> — <code>lib/Config/ZitadelConfig</code></dt>
        <dd>Single immutable <code>readonly class</code> passed to the middleware. All options are
        constructor parameters; see the <a href="guides/index.html">configuration reference</a>.</dd>
    </dl>

    <hr>

    <h2>API Reference</h2>

    {% set node = project.namespace %}

    {% if usesNamespaces or not usesPackages %}
        {% set namespaces = node.children %}
        {% for namespace in namespaces %}
            <h3>{{ namespace|route('class:short') }}</h3>
            {% if namespace.namespaces is not empty %}
                <dl class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents">
                {% for child in namespace.namespaces %}
                    <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -namespace">{{ child|route('class:short') }}</dt>
                {% endfor %}
                </dl>
            {% endif %}
            {% if namespace.classes is not empty %}
                <dl class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents">
                {% for class in namespace.classes %}
                    <dt class="phpdocumentor-table-of-contents__entry -class">{{ class|route('class:short') }}</dt>
                    {%- if class.summary %}<dd>{{ class.summary }}</dd>{% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
                </dl>
            {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}

</article>
{% endblock %}
